DESCRIPTION:Roadtrip To Outta Space | Arena Wien - Große Halle | "Pink" 20th Anniversary EU/UK Tour 2026  Der Vorverkauf beginnt am 29. Mai um 10 Uhr Presale starts on May 29th at 10am  Boris formed in 1992 and eventually arrived at the band’s current lineup of Takeshi\, Wata\, and Atsuo in 1996.  In the years since\, Boris has tirelessly explored their own rendition of what is heavy through methods entirely their own. Though the depths of their “heaviness” may intensify\, their unique musicianship defies classification in any one genre or style\, so let’s just call it real “heavy music” in extreme color. Their music has been called a “game changer” regarding the leading edge of the world’s rock scene\, and that influence is limitless. They enter realms that cannot be described simply in terms of the “explosive sound” or “thunderous roars” that have become their trademark. www.borisheavyrocks.com  Planning For Burial is a blackened slowcore project from Wilkes Barre\, Pennsylvania. planningforburial.bandcamp.com/   Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 28 (+ € 3 Fee) Abendkassa/Box-office tba.
